{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：15:01 2026-10-20 HKT<br/>發佈時間：15:01 2026-10-20 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：15:01 2026-10-20 HKT</p><img alt=\"爆炸品處理課人員到場。楊偉亨攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ur/sthl_square/eb142028803fac9edb8877df02e500c1/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-20_at_14_54_26.jpeg\"/><p>今（20日）中午12時16分，油麻地上海街油麻地公共圖書館，一樓的傷健人士洗手間，被發現有白色粉末，職員報警求助。警員到場封鎖調查，並通知炸彈品處理課到場，其後人員檢走一箱證物離開。現場現已解封。事件有待調查。</p><img alt=\"爆炸品處理課人員檢走證物。楊偉亨攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/632f4c91fab1f7eb6c6d3201a5c01300/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-20_at_14_54_24.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"爆炸品處理課人員到場。楊偉亨攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/490f94666d446cebc2b67363ecdab891/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-20_at_14_54_30_1_.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/9355ad52a7b6c1c5f4f6d1ce9391e3f0/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-20_at_14_54_30.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"警員到場調查。楊偉亨攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/1d62c840a1f050cb0ce5c5ffaa739cce/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-20_at_14_54_28_1_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"現場為油麻地公共圖書館。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/41a1acaaef9276d43161f0b9595595b9/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-20_at_14_54_28.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"警員到場調查。楊偉亨攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b348316c088fea6e043b5639481a8bda/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-20_at_14_54_27_1_.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ef7ce7a6755a78f27fd644668e3f8401/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-20_at_14_54_27.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b5d9ea29c7adaacdea44c49875df2f2c/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-20_at_14_54_24_2_.jpeg\"/><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-20T12:04:05.972545+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":188,"images":9,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-20T07:01:35+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-20T11:58:09.141025+00:00","content_updated_at":"2